    "title": "Preliminary Summary of Acceleration-Basis and Localization Exchange in Exchange-Interference Scattering-Matrix Fermion-Like Collisions",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21333768",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-13",
    "description": "This preliminary summary reports exchange-interference scattering-matrix experiments in a closed phase system. It evaluates whether an acceleration-like AB two-body readout is preserved while low odd-harmonic bottoms, one-sided high-harmonic conditions, recursive scattering, and reflection-rate sweeps are recorded as localization-index exchange in the outgoing channels.",
